## Design Tokens

Spacing: 4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 24 / 32. Prefer 8 and 12. Main pad 32px. Chart gutter 16px. WorkSmart gutter 24px. Rail 224px.

Type: Inter only. tabular-nums. 32px/600 KPI · 24–28px/600 h1 (−0.6px) · 14px/400–500 body · 12px/500 meta · 11px/500 labels. Do not introduce a second family. Do not default body to 16px.

Dark (default HQ): canvas `#0a0f1e` · surface `#111827` · surface-2 `#1a2340` · border `#26304d` · text `#e8ecf5` / `#9aa5c0` · interactive `#6366f1` · lime `#b8f000` · + `#d4ee57` · − `#fb7185`

Light: canvas `#f7f8fb` · surface `#ffffff` · text `#1a2340` / `#5b6788` · + `#3d6b1f` · − `#b42318` · same indigo and lime

Radius: 8px controls · 12px lists/cards · 16px chart sections · pill chips. Cards have 1px border, not drop shadow.

Motion: color 150ms / sidebar width 200ms / cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1). Respect the global `prefers-reduced-motion` kill-switch. `:focus-visible` 2px `#6366f1`.

## Taste Directives

- When placing brand color on a button, KPI, chart, or nav item, always keep `#b8f000` on the LG glyph sitting on navy and route clicks through `#6366f1` — because a highlighter as body type burns out the mark
- When grouping a card, chart, or SMART block, always stack navy planes (`#0a0f1e` → `#111827`) with 1px `#26304d` and 12–16px radii — because elevation around numbers reads as a storefront template
- When setting type for tables, KR lists, nav, and ticks, always use Inter at 11–14px/400–500 with 24–28px titles — because the job is comparing statuses in one 900px viewport
- When building unauthenticated vs authenticated chrome, always split login 50/50 (navy brand / white form) and keep the app as a 224px rail with no desktop header — because the first screen sells Land Grow and every later screen is work
- When coloring money, always use the theme pair (light olive/red, dark yellow-green/rose), never lime on a light surface

## Anti-patterns

- Never paint CTAs, headings, or table numbers in `#b8f000` on `#f7f8fb` or `#ffffff`
- Never add blur drop shadows under HQ cards, KPI tiles, or WorkSmart panels (TaskModal overlay is the only `shadow-2xl` exception)
- Never add a second typeface or a marketing 16px body in authenticated routes
- Never restore a desktop top header (“Administração” as a bar) — it belongs in the rail
- Never use photography, illustration, or gradient heroes inside the app shell
- Never treat indigo as a large fill; it stays on selected nav, buttons, and focus rings (<1% area)
- Avoid 6px/10px new spacing unless matching the existing rail; new UI sits on 4/8/12/16
- Avoid Sheet enter 500ms on high-frequency actions; 150–200ms color/transform is the product rhythm
